msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"There's a truck that's always parked at this one particular spot in "
"Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I heard it's loaded with some real suspicious merchandise..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr "Ad esempio?"

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm not exactly sure. But there're always these shady looking "
"characters hanging around it, so it could be anything for all I know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Also, I'm pretty sure I've seen somebody moving around in there, but my "
"guess is he doesn't want to be seen since I've never seen his face before."
msgstr ""

